COMMENT ON COLUMN kernel.vault_grant_requests.subject IS 'DID granting access (principalDid for static secrets, node DID for a self-grant). NULL on pre-#1603 rows, read as the node DID.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN vault_grant_requests.granted_to; Type: COMMENT; Schema: kernel; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN kernel.vault_grant_requests.granted_to IS 'DID receiving access (connector app DID for static secrets, node DID for a self-grant). NULL on pre-#1603 rows, read as the node DID. NOT the ECDH recipient — the field key is always wrapped to node_x_pub.';


